earing plate is designed to rock 0.5 deg about the hardened precision ground outer ring</li><li>The second key design feature of the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate is its ability to roll</li><li>The shape formed by the rock and roll features allows the Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing plate to rotate about its center</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides twice the load capacity of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and six times the load capacity of conventional linear bearings</li><li>The Super Smart Ball Bushing&reg; bearing provides eight times the travel life of the industry standard Thomson&reg; Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing and 216 times the travel life of conventional linear bearings</li><li>Its unique design with the steel band enables the bearing to preserve it&apos;s ID fit-up and self-aligning capability over extended use</li><li>A universal self-alignment feature optimizes load distribution between ball tracks and assures uniform ball loading over the entire length of the bearing plate</li><li>This patented product provides smooth, quiet, low drag linear movement at 6x the load capacity or 216 x the L10 travel life of a conventional steel linear ball bushing bearing</li><li>These universally self-aligning bearings offer twice the load capacity or eight times the travel life of our Super Ball Bushing&reg; bearing</li><li>For class L, end supported shafting</li><li>Self-aligning</li><li>No wipers</li></ul>","Images":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SS6U8.jpg | https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/IMAGES/ITEMS/ORIGINAL_HIGHRES/Thomson_SS6U8_1.jpg","PDF":"https://externalassets.unilogcorp.com/ASSETS/DOCUMENTS/ITEMS/EN/Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf Thomson_FNYBU06_Catalog.pdf","Bearing Material":"Steel","Length":"1-1/4 in","Load Capacity":"265 lb Dynamic","Outside Diameter":"7/8 in","Shaft Diameter":"1/2 in","Temperature Rating":"1